OL,3,GNEWSAHomes set to go ahead despite
OL,4,Aenvironmental fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build over 150 canalside homes
OL,7,Fhave been recommended for approval,
OL,8,Fdespite concerns over their potential
OL,9,Fimpact on the environment.
OL,11,FThe proposals for the scheme next to
OL,12,Fthe Aire and Calder Navigation form
OL,13,Fpart of Wakefield's wider City Fields
OL,14,Fdevelopment.
OL,16,FThe application is the fourth in a
OL,17,Fseries for new housing on land
OL,18,Fcurrently owned by Wakefield Council.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
